w prints non-zero billed today and Central reset. Keep every existing test passing (tests/autopilot*.test.mjs, tests/policy*.test.mjs, tests/daily-limit*.test.mjs, tests/budget-set.test.mjs). No token-shaped literals in files. ignoreTests reason: tests that reference swarm.mjs or autopilot.mjs in passing are covered by CI and the full suite run before merge.",
